                                                "example_id": "465265f2-9114-4992-8d23-e80e1f3a6d7e",
                                                "sense_id": "1b2c7ebd-ad21-3a3c-b7d6-934c94bb122e",
                                                "text": "In 2023, WeightWatchers bought the telehealth start-up, Sequence, for $106mn."
